The BMW 325d was part of the F30 generation (2012-2019), with updated versions available after the 2015 facelift (LCI) [4, 7, 9, 12, 18]. The most recent version would be from the later years of the F30 production, likely 2016-2018, before the G20 generation was introduced in 2018 [9, 18, 35]. The 325d was not carried over to the G20 generation [35].

